这是北京众多改造项目之一。

168
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:42,120
And I started coming here because I had a friend who had a Bai Zhou tasting business here.
我开始来这里是因为有个朋友在这里经营百州品鉴业务。

169
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,120
So this area started hosting.
于是这个地区开始举办活动。

170
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:49,120
Yeah, but it adopted this idea of fine wine tasting method.
是的，但它采用了精致品酒的方式。

171
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:51,120
So I started coming here.
于是我开始常来这里。

172
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,120
How much tolerance do you need to have?
需要有多大的容忍度？

173
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:57,120
You just need to be from Dongbei, and you'll be okay.
只要你是东北人，就没问题。

174
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:04,120
I started seeing amazing coffee shops and the art gallery that's here,
我开始看到这里的超赞咖啡店和艺术画廊，

175
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:08,120
and then all of these fairs markets started happening,
随后各种集市和市集相继出现，

176
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:13,120
and then they brought back the Chinese New Year, the spring festival market here, which was this was...
他们又把春节的庙会市场带回来了，

177
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,620
It's almost like a temple fair.
几乎就像庙会。

178
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,620
It is.
确实如此。

179
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:23,120
And it's kind of like this new high-tech venue with a very traditional core of Chinese culture inside of it,
它更像是一个新型高科技场馆，却蕴含着极具传统的中华文化核心，

180
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,120
especially at this time of the year.
尤其在这个季节。

181
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:32,120
And I don't know if you've been to these, they have other really amazing live house places right outside.
我不知道你是否去过这些地方，它们在外面还有其他非常棒的现场演出场所。

182
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,120
I haven't been, I only scratched the surface today.
我还没去过，我今天只浅尝辄止。

183
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,620
It's worth exploring.
值得去探索。

184
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:39,120
It's definitely worth exploring at this time of the year, and at all times of the year.
在这个季节以及全年都绝对值得探索。

185
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:42,120
This is a great block of the city for me.
对我来说，这是一块很棒的城市街区。

186
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,620
I love it.
我很喜欢。

187
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:45,120
It was eye-opening for me, but Li Lun, for you?
对我而言这是一次开眼界的经历，李伦，你呢？

188
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:51,120
Yeah, I think from its name, I mean, Long Fu means prosper and blessings, and you could...
是的，我觉得从名字来看，‘龙福’意味着繁荣和祝福，你可以……

189
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:58,120
I think this area is perfect for Chinese New Year celebrations and festive activities.
我认为这片区域非常适合春节庆祝和节日活动。

190
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,620
And I walked around the neighborhood.
我在邻里四处走了走。

191
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:05,120
I think it's a perfect combination, a blending of, as Alex was saying, futuristic designs.
我觉得这是一个完美的结合，正如Alex所说的，融合了未来主义设计。

192
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:08,120
I see a baker shop that looks really beautiful.
我看到一家看起来非常漂亮的面包店。

193
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:11,120
I see a coffee shop that I really want to go into.
我看到一家我非常想进去的咖啡店。

194
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:18,120
And I also see these very traditional shops or fairs that sell traditional decorations,
我还看到这些非常传统的商店或集市，出售传统装饰，

195
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:22,120
also encouraging or promoting Chinese culture and so on.
也在鼓励或推广中国文化等。

196
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:25,120
So it's really fun to take a walk in this neighborhood.
在这个社区散步真的很有趣。

197
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:29,120
I grew up in Beijing, but it's pretty different.
我在北京长大，但这里相当不同。

198
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:35,120
The way I remember here, when you take a walk along the Long Fu Street,
我记得这里，当你沿着龙府街散步时，

199
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:39,120
when you hit the northern part, it's almost like the end.
到达北部时，几乎像是尽头。

200
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:46,120
But right now, you can take a walk further north, and then you take a right turn, you go to the Long Fu Street area.
但现在，你可以再往北走，然后右转，就到达龙府街地区。

201
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,620
It's a very clear road map.
这是一张非常清晰的路线图。

202
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:53,120
Yes, you could take a further city walk, and you can explore all of the places of interest here.
是的，你可以继续在城市中漫步，探索这里所有的景点。

203
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:57,120
So it's definitely a new experience, especially for the younger generation.
因此这绝对是一种新体验，尤其是对年轻一代来说。

204
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,620
Absolutely.
当然。

205
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:01,120
I'm going to bring my parents here, and I'm going to show them, you know,
我打算带父母来这里，向他们展示，你知道的，

206
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:06,120
this is the new Beijing, even I would love to experience.
这就是新北京，我也很想亲身体验。

207
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:11,120
But everything was about horse, as you can see from the decor.
但一切都围绕马展开，正如你从装饰中看到的。

208
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,620
Very horsey.
非常马主题。

209
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,120
Very horsey.
非常马主题。

210
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,620
Very horsey.
非常马主题。

211
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,620
Where do we start?
我们从哪里开始？

212
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,620
Where do we start?
我们从哪里开始？

213
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,120
I think, how about this?
我想，这个怎么样？

214
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:24,120
We each pick one thing, one object from those on display, and talk about it.
我们每人从展出的物品中挑选一样，然后谈论它。

215
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,620
Sure.
好的。

216
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,620
Let's start from you.
我们先从你开始。

217
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,620
Okay, okay.
好的，好吧。

218
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:30,120
So I will talk about two things that I agree.
那么我会谈论两件我同意的事。

219
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,620
Okay.
好的。

220
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,620
Yeah.
嗯。

221
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,120
So the first one is a decoration.
那么第一个是装饰品。

222
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:37,120
It's called Ma Shang You Fu.
它叫“马上有福”。

223
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:41,120
So it means you have blessings very immediately at once.
意思是立刻就会有福气。

224
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:43,120
And there are little bells as well.
而且还有小铃铛。

225
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,120
Yeah, there are little bells that can make the sound.
是的，有能发声的小铃铛。

226
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:47,120
You can hang it up on the door.
你可以把它挂在门上。

227
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,120
As if when the horse was running.
就像马在奔跑时一样。

228
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,620
Yeah, exactly, exactly.
对，正是如此，正是如此。

229
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:55,120
And the other one is a magnet that you can put on the fridge.
另一个是可以贴在冰箱上的磁铁。

230
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,120
So it's called Ma Shang You Qian.
所以它叫马上有钱。

231
00:11:57,120 --> 00:12:02,120
So if you shake it, there's actually little gold powders behind it.
所以如果摇动它，里面实际上有细小的金粉。

232
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,120
So it's basically when you...
所以基本上就是当你……

233
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,620
How much is gold these days?
现在金价是多少？

234
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,620
A lot.
很多。

235
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,620
I don't think it's real gold.
我不认为这是真金。

236
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,620
Even with the fall, still a lot.
即使跌了，仍然很多。

237
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,120
Yeah, I don't think it's real gold.
是的，我不认为这是真金。

238
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:17,120
But the thing about it that I want to introduce is that the phrase that we use every day, Ma Shang.
但我想介绍的点是，我们每天使用的词语‘马上’。

239
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,120
It actually means on horseback.
它实际上是指‘骑马’。

240
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:25,120
So basically because we put these gold powders or the blessings on the horseback, it means,
所以基本上因为我们把这些金粉或祝福放在‘骑马’上，它的意思是，

241
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:30,120
both means, you know, literally quite literally, you know, the horse is carrying the blessing or the wealth.
这两个意思，你知道，字面上说，马正背着祝福或财富。

242
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:37,120
But it also means, you know, you can get these blessings or wealth very instantly or, you know, very recent or, you know, very rapidly.
但它也意味着，你可以非常即时、非常近期、非常快速地获得这些祝福或财富。

243
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:42,120
So I hope, you know, these can bring, you know, good fortune and blessing to all of you.
所以我希望，这些能给大家带来好运和祝福。

244
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,620
Yeah.
嗯。

245
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:48,120
This is interesting because Ma Shang, literally, I'm on the horse.
这很有趣，因为‘马上’，字面上是‘我在马背上’。

246
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,620
Oh, right, right.
哦，对，对。

247
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,620
But it's been...
但是它已经……

248
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,620
Never thought about it, right?
从未想过，对吧？

249
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,620
Yeah, no.
是的，不是。

250
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:57,120
It's used on an everyday way, meaning immediately, I'm on it.
它在日常用语中表示‘立即’，即‘我在上面’。

251
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,620
Right, right, right.
对，对，对。

252
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,620
You know, isn't that how...
你知道，那不是这样吗……

253
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:01,120
Yeah, you never thought about it.
是的，你从未想过。

254
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,120
I never thought about it, but it makes...
我从未想过，但它让……

255
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:06,120
But you're an expert of Chinese culture and philosophy.
但你是中国文化和哲学的专家。

256
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:09,120
It makes total sense.
完全有道理。

257
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:21,120
I mean, right, in general, the horse, the domestication of the horse was the beginning of a large-scale area trade and commerce along the Silk Road.
我的意思是，一般来说，马的驯化是丝绸之路大规模地区贸易和商业的开端。

258
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,120
Later on and even earlier.
后来甚至更早。

259
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:26,120
So it's a great symbol, right?
所以它是一个很好的象征，对吧？

260
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:31,120
And I think the idea and the veneration of the horse is shared by many cultures.
我认为对马的观念和崇敬在许多文化中都是共有的。

261
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:34,120
And so I think this also...
所以我觉得这也……

262
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,620
For the Chinese?
对中国人来说？

263
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,620
Yeah, for the Chinese...
是的，对中国人来说……

264
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,620
What does the horse mean?
马意味着什么？

265
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:49,120
I mean, if we look at this one here, the black one, this is like modeled after an archetype, a bronze-ware horse from a western Zhou dynasty.
我的意思是，如果我们看这里这匹黑马，它是仿照西周时期的一件青铜马的原型。

266
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:57,120
So from the western Zhou, we're talking about 3,000 years to 2,700 years approximately.
所以说，这件西周的青铜马大约距今三千年至二千七百年。

267
00:13:57,120 --> 00:14:00,120
So very ancient art form.
因此是非常古老的艺术形式。

268
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:02,120
I thought it was a dog from a distance.
我远处还以为它是一只狗。

269
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:05,120
It's like a little dragon or something.
它像是一条小龙之类的。

270
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:09,120
You could see the bronze-ware on the forehead ornament.
你可以看到额饰上的青铜器。

271
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,120
So this part.
那么这一部分。

272
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,620
This is part.
这是这一部分。

273
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:18,120
This part is the symbol of the frontal ornament of a horse that was used in those years.
这一部分是当年用于马的前部装饰的象征。

274
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:24,120
And I think the horse, you find it in Chinese mythology in many places, right?
我认为马在中国神话中出现很多，对吧？

275
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:26,120
There's also dragon horses, right?
还有龙马，对吧？

276
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:30,120
The dragon horse that...
那种龙马……

277
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,620
Long Ma.
龙马。

278
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:35,120
Long Ma is actually used together to describe a kind of spirit.
龙马实际上是用来描述一种精神的。

279
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,120
We say Long Ma, Jin Shen.
我们说龙马，金神。

280
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,620
What would that mean?
那意味着什么？

281
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,620
Help us.
帮助我们。

282
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:41,120
Long Ma, Jin Shen is basically...
龙马，金神基本上是……

283
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:47,120
I guess that I'm imagining that word came about when people were thinking,
我想我是在想，当人们思考时，这个词产生了，

284
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:51,120
what are the two most uplifting energetic animals out here that we have?
我们这里最振奋人心的两种充满活力的动物是什么？

285
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:55,120
One that runs on the street, one that swims in the ocean super fast,
一种在陆地上奔跑，一种在海里高速游动。

286
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,120
and it's the dragon and the horse, and we put them together.
它是龙和马，我们把它们组合在一起。

287
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:00,120
If you want to be in a good spirit, you want to go somewhere in a spurring spirit,
如果你想保持好心情，就想去一个鼓舞精神的地方，

288
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,120
then that's these two animals combined together.
那就是这两种动物的组合。

289
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:08,120
So we use that phrase to describe someone who's in a really energetic mental state,
所以我们用这个短语来形容精神状态非常充沛的人，

290
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:13,120
and you're ready for the challenge to go forward, which you're going to hear that a lot.
你已经准备好迎接前进的挑战，这句话你会经常听到。

291
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:16,120
We have heard that a lot because this is the year of the horse,
我们经常听到这句话，因为今年是马年，

292
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:20,120
and people are using that phrase to wish each other good luck going forward.
人们用这句话互相祝愿前程顺利。

293
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:27,120
And the year of the horse, of course, in terms of calendrix, ancient classical, pre-modern Chinese calendrix,
当然，马年在历法上，指的是古代经典的前现代中国历法，

294
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:30,120
it means the highest point of yang.
它代表阳气的最高点。

295
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:37,120
Usually it's also related to the summer solstice, and it also, inside the horse, there's also yin,
通常它也与夏至有关，而且在马之中也蕴含阴气，

296
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:44,120
because it's the change from the highest yang to going back to the yin to the cycle.
因为这是从最高的阳转向阴的循环变化。

297
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:49,120
So I think there's a lot of symbolism in this ancient...
所以我认为这其中蕴含了大量的古代象征意义……

298
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:53,120
But for sure it's power, it's strength, it's vitality, speed, and...
但可以肯定的是，它象征力量、强壮、活力、速度，……

299
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:57,120
It's at the root of civilization, in a sense, right, the lungma.
从某种意义上说，它是文明的根基，所谓的「龙马」。

300
00:15:57,120 --> 00:16:00,120
I think it's carried in this...
我认为它体现在这……

301
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:06,120
There's one myth from Han Dynasty where the dragon horse is emerging from a river
有一个来自汉代的神话，讲述龙马从河中出现。

302
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:09,120
and carrying the lua too, I think.
我想它还背着 lua。

303
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:18,120
And it's a symbolic map that the ancient kings used to organize society.
这是一幅象征性的图，古代君王用来组织社会。

304
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:26,120
So it's a very fascinating, very deep symbolism related to this.
因此，这其中蕴含着非常有趣、非常深刻的象征意义。

305
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:28,120
So let me put it back.
那我把它放回去。

306
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:31,120
You know it has a name. It's called chi-chi.
你知道它有名字，叫‘奇奇’。

307
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:37,120
It's one of four mascots of the Spring Festival Gala
它是春节联欢晚会四大吉祥物之一。

308
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:41,120
that's going on as chi-chi.
正在以‘奇奇’的形象出现。

309
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:45,120
And it's very fashionable. It has the hairstyle, it has the...
而且它很时尚，有这种发型，还有……

310
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:47,120
I know, it's a very good line.
我知道，这是一句很好的台词。

311
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:50,120
A very majestic looking, sophisticated looking horse.
一匹非常威严、气质高雅的马。

312
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:54,120
But it's not everything, right? There are other types of horse as well.
但它并不是全部，对吧？还有其他类型的马。

313
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:56,120
So I think you want to pick yours.
所以我想你想挑选属于自己的那匹。

314
00:16:56,120 --> 00:17:00,120
Well, how do I put mine into the context?
那么，我该如何把我的放入这个语境呢？

315
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:04,119
This is kind of a black horse when it comes to...
说到这里，它有点像一匹黑马。

316
00:17:04,119 --> 00:17:07,119
Now we see the stand-up comedy.
现在我们来看单口喜剧。

