322
00:17:25,119 --> 00:17:28,119
Very Chinese. And it's a little labubu.
非常中国化，而且是一个小的labubu。

323
00:17:28,119 --> 00:17:33,119
And I was not a collector of labubu until my friends made the request.
在朋友提出请求之前，我并不是labubu的收藏者。

324
00:17:33,119 --> 00:17:38,119
