but I just felt very proud because it's just very Chinese.
但我仍感到非常自豪，因为它非常中国化。

329
00:17:58,119 --> 00:18:01,119
Yeah, we do a lot of work telling China stories abroad, and there you have it.
是的，我们在海外讲述中国故事做了很多工作，就这样。

330
00:18:01,119 --> 00:18:04,119
And the labubu just went, hey, I look kind of gimmicky.
而labubu则觉得，嘿，我看起来有点花哨。

331
00:18:04,119 --> 00:18:06,119
Scary, sweet.
可怕，甜美。

332
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:10,119
I'm a scary, kind of ugly little thing, but now everybody in the world loves me.
我是一只可怕、稍显丑陋的小东西，但现在全世界的人都喜欢我。

333
00:18:10,119 --> 00:18:12,119
