我也希望我的工作能这么轻松。

334
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:17,119
This is a very fierce competition with this one as well.
这也是一场非常激烈的竞争。

335
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:21,119
What about... Just a moment, hold that one.
那……等一下，先把那个拿住。

336
00:18:21,119 --> 00:18:23,119
What is with that one?
那个是怎么回事？

337
00:18:23,119 --> 00:18:28,119
I don't know if you all have seen this, but this is the sad horse, the crying horse thing
我不知道大家有没有见过，但这就是那匹悲伤的马，哭泣的马。

338
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:33,119
that became a blessing in this steak, because this was a manufacturing mistake.
它在这块牛排里成了福气，因为这是一次生产失误。

