它叫‘暴躁猫’。

351
00:19:07,119 --> 00:19:08,619
Oh yeah.
哦，是的。

352
00:19:08,119 --> 00:19:10,119
Have you seen that cat? The cat had a very similar...
你看过那只猫吗？那只猫非常相似……

353
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:14,119
Somehow, people are attracted to grumpyness.
不知为何，人们被暴躁的情绪所吸引。

354
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:20,119
Because I think people just want to express the true feelings that they harbor, like inside nowadays.
因为我觉得人们只是想表达他们内心深处真实的感受。

355
00:19:20,119 --> 00:19:22,119
By nature, we are grumpy animals.
从本性上讲，我们是暴躁的动物。

356
00:19:22,119 --> 00:19:24,119
This is us. This is human.
这就是我们，这就是人类。

357
00:19:24,119 --> 00:19:25,619
That's how we...
这就是我们的……

358
00:19:25,119 --> 00:19:30,119
