这是我为自己准备的东西。

363
00:19:38,119 --> 00:19:46,119
I think for us Chinese people, it's not that I'm only thinking about money, but wishing people an abundance and fortune.
我想对我们中国人来说，我并非只想着金钱，而是祝愿大家富足和好运。

364
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,619
You don't have to explain.
你不必解释。

365
00:19:47,119 --> 00:19:48,619
In the New Year.
在新年时。

366
00:19:48,119 --> 00:19:49,619
In the New Year.
在新年时。

367
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:57,119
We'd like to make sure that in the New Year, we wish each other an overflow of fortune.
我们希望在新年里，彼此祝福财运滚滚。

368
00:19:57,119 --> 00:20:01,119
And that will bring peace, it will bring health and bring everything good.
这会带来和平、健康以及一切美好。

369
00:20:01,119 --> 00:20:04,119
So I always buy something like this for myself.
所以我总是为自己买这样的东西。

370
00:20:04,119 --> 00:20:06,119
And then this is the Chinese knot on top of it.
然后这上面系着一个中国结。

371
00:20:06,119 --> 00:20:08,119
I think everybody knows what it is.
我想大家都知道那是什么。

372
00:20:08,119 --> 00:20:09,619
And this is good luck and blessing.
这象征着好运和祝福。

373
00:20:09,119 --> 00:20:13,119
So I always make sure that I have something on my back like this.
所以我总是确保背后有这样的东西。

374
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:15,119
This is my New Year. Good luck to myself.
这就是我的新年，祝自己好运。

375
00:20:15,119 --> 00:20:16,619
Great, great.
太好了，太好了。

376
00:20:16,119 --> 00:20:20,119
So that's what I love about for holiday season is it's all about good wishes.
这就是我喜欢节日季的原因，一切都是关于美好祝愿。

377
00:20:20,119 --> 00:20:21,619
Yeah.
是的。

378
00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:22,619
Right? It's about being kindly.
对吧？这关乎善意。

379
00:20:22,119 --> 00:20:23,619
It's the spirit.
这就是精神。

380
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:28,119
Yeah, it's all about sharing your good fortune, sharing good wealth.
是的，这全是关于分享你的好运，分享财富。

381
00:20:28,119 --> 00:20:31,119
It's everything good and happy colors.
这是一切美好和快乐的事物。

382
00:20:31,119 --> 00:20:32,619
Red, you know.
红色，你知道的。

383
00:20:32,119 --> 00:20:34,119
Yellow, red, bright colors.
黄色、红色、明亮的颜色。

384
00:20:34,119 --> 00:20:37,119
And when people see each other, they say, 恭喜發財 meaning, you know.
And when people see each other, they say, 恭喜發財 meaning, you know. 当人们见面时，他们会说‘恭喜发财’，意思是，你懂的。

385
00:20:37,119 --> 00:20:38,619
I hope you get rich.
我希望你发财。

386
00:20:38,119 --> 00:20:39,619
Yeah, exactly.
是的，正是如此。

387
00:20:39,119 --> 00:20:40,619
Please get rich.
请发财。

388
00:20:40,119 --> 00:20:43,119
You know, they're good blessings to each other.
你知道的，他们互相送上美好的祝福。

389
00:20:43,119 --> 00:20:44,619
Yes.
是的。

390
00:20:44,119 --> 00:20:45,619
What do I talk about?
我该说些什么呢？

391
00:20:45,119 --> 00:20:46,619
So it's my turn.
所以轮到我了。

392
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:48,119
I wanted to talk about this.
我想谈谈这个。

393
00:20:48,119 --> 00:20:50,119
We can talk more about this.
我们可以进一步讨论这个。

394
00:20:50,119 --> 00:20:51,619
Talk more about this.
再多谈谈这个。

395
00:20:51,119 --> 00:20:54,119
It's just, and this one is written here, 馬上有錢.
It's just, and this one is written here, 馬上有錢. 只是，这里写着，馬上有錢。

396
00:20:54,119 --> 00:20:55,619
Yeah, exactly.
是的，没错。

397
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:56,619
It's the same, right?
是一样的，对吧？

398
00:20:56,119 --> 00:20:57,619
馬上有錢.
馬上有錢. 馬上有錢。

399
00:20:57,119 --> 00:20:58,619
Get rich instantly.
立刻致富。

400
00:20:58,119 --> 00:20:59,619
Yeah, let's put this next.
好的，接下来放这个。

401
00:20:59,119 --> 00:21:00,619
馬上有錢.
馬上有錢. 馬上有錢。

402
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:01,619
They belong together.
它们是一起的。

403
00:21:01,119 --> 00:21:02,619
They belong together.
它们是一起的。

404
00:21:02,119 --> 00:21:05,119
And it brings money to you.
并且它会给你带来金钱。

405
00:21:05,119 --> 00:21:06,619
Exactly.
正是如此。

406
00:21:06,119 --> 00:21:08,119
And now this is a sensation because it was a mistake.
现在这成了轰动，因为它是个错误。

407
00:21:08,119 --> 00:21:11,119
Right now it's selling like, so why?
现在它卖得很火，为什么？

408
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:14,119
This makes me, you know, what's behind it?
这让我想知道，背后是什么？

409
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:17,119
Are people life mistaken things or?
人们的生活是误解的东西吗？

410
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:18,619
Yeah, accidents.
是的，意外。

411
00:21:18,119 --> 00:21:19,619
Accidents.
意外。

412
00:21:19,119 --> 00:21:20,619
Yeah, why?
是的，为什么？

413
00:21:20,119 --> 00:21:21,619
Why do accidents happen?
为什么会发生意外？

414
00:21:21,119 --> 00:21:24,119
It's a meaningful coincidence, right?
这是一种有意义的巧合，对吧？

415
00:21:24,119 --> 00:21:25,619
A meaningful accident in a sense.
从某种意义上说，这是一次有意义的意外。

416
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:26,619
Why?
为什么？

417
00:21:26,119 --> 00:21:27,619
What does it tell us about ourselves?
这告诉我们关于自己的什么？

418
00:21:27,119 --> 00:21:35,119
I mean, there's, if I'm allowed to go back to another classical passage in Hanfei, there's...
我的意思是，如果允许的话，我想回到韩非的另一段经典语录，那里有……

419
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:37,119
Please, that's why we have your hair.
请，这就是我们拥有你的头发的原因。

420
00:21:37,119 --> 00:21:38,619
Exactly.
正是如此。

421
00:21:38,119 --> 00:21:43,119
There's, I remember there's a passage in Hanfei where someone writes a letter of
我记得《韩非》中有一段，某人写了一封信

422
00:21:43,119 --> 00:21:49,119
complaint to the king and then he tells his servant more light or raised the lamp.
向国王投诉，然后他告诉仆人‘more light’或点亮灯

423
00:21:49,119 --> 00:21:56,119
And then accidentally while he's saying that, he's also writing more light in this letter.
然后他一边说这话，一边不小心在信里写下‘more light’

424
00:21:56,119 --> 00:22:01,119
And then the king and the minister are reading this letter.
于是国王和大臣在阅读这封信

425
00:22:01,119 --> 00:22:05,119
And actually they don't really pay attention to the content of the actual letter,
实际上他们并没有真正关注信的内容

426
00:22:05,119 --> 00:22:08,119
but they only see this phrase more light.
而只看到这句‘more light’

427
00:22:08,119 --> 00:22:10,119
And they think it's on purpose.
他们认为这是故意的

428
00:22:10,119 --> 00:22:13,119
They think it's not a careless mistake, but on purpose.
他们认为这不是粗心的错误，而是有意为之

429
00:22:13,119 --> 00:22:15,119
And they think it's a message.
他们认为这是一条信息

430
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:21,119
And so what they derive from it is that they should employ more capable people to develop
于是他们从中得出结论，应该任用更有能力的人来发展

431
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:25,119
further the administration so people will have a better life, right?
进一步完善行政，让人民生活更好，对吧

432
00:22:25,119 --> 00:22:32,119
So this careless mistake becomes, is leading to a meaningful development, right?
于是这个粗心的错误反而引领了有意义的发展，对吗

433
00:22:32,119 --> 00:22:40,119
There is some deeper meaning to be explored with regard to the question of happiness, I think, right?
我认为，关于幸福这一问题还有更深层的意义值得探讨，对吧

434
00:22:40,119 --> 00:22:51,119
So I think this element of happiness, which accidentally comes in in a meaningful way with this symbol,
所以我认为，这个偶然以有意义的方式出现的幸福元素

435
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:54,119
is really an important topic.
实际上是一个重要的话题

436
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:56,119
What can make us happy?
什么能让我们感到幸福？

437
00:22:56,119 --> 00:23:02,119
Is it just only about money or also about leading a simpler life maybe,
这仅仅是关于金钱，还是也涉及过更简朴的生活呢？

438
00:23:02,119 --> 00:23:06,119
or finding a way where we can be truly happy with our loved ones?
或者找到一种方式，让我们与所爱的人真正感到幸福？

439
00:23:06,119 --> 00:23:11,119
And I think the Spring Festival is actually always a reminder, right?
我认为春节其实一直是一个提醒，对吧？

440
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:13,119
We get together with our family.
我们与家人团聚。

441
00:23:13,119 --> 00:23:16,119
We lead a simple life.
我们过简朴的生活。

442
00:23:16,119 --> 00:23:18,119
We do simple things.
我们做简单的事。

443
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:20,119
We are kind to each other.
我们彼此友善。

444
00:23:20,119 --> 00:23:28,119
So I think this is a very good tradition and a very mindful event every year.
所以我认为这是一项非常好的传统，也是每年都很有意义的活动。

445
00:23:28,119 --> 00:23:34,119
Very thoughtful event happening in China that it's grounding people, in a sense.
这是一项在中国举行的非常有深意的活动，在某种程度上让人感到踏实。

446
00:23:34,119 --> 00:23:39,119
I must say it's like at the end of the year or at the beginning of the year, as the seasons change,
我必须说，这就像在年末或年初，随着季节的更替，

447
00:23:39,119 --> 00:23:44,119
as the year changes, we kind of take stock of what happened, right, in the past year.
随着年份的变化，我们会对过去一年发生的事情进行盘点，对吧？

448
00:23:44,119 --> 00:23:48,119
And we think about going forward, the uncertainties, of course,
我们思考未来，当然会有不确定性，

449
00:23:48,119 --> 00:23:57,119
but also what have we learned, what has happened, have I become wiser?
但也会思考我们学到了什么，发生了什么，我是否变得更聪明了？

450
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:59,119
Of course, money-wise, everybody wants to.
当然，金钱方面，大家都想要。

451
00:23:59,119 --> 00:24:06,119
But deep down, I think, is that search for more meaning in life, greater wisdom,
但从内心深处，我认为，这是一种对生活更深意义、更大智慧的追寻。

452
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:09,119
more harmonious relationship.
更和谐的关系。

453
00:24:09,119 --> 00:24:13,119
It is actually an emotional period of time.
这实际上是一个情感时期。

454
00:24:13,119 --> 00:24:16,119
Absolutely. I think a lot of people would do a post-mortem,
当然。我认为很多人会事后检讨，

455
00:24:16,119 --> 00:24:19,119
and they would think about, you know, there's outlook for the next year.
他们会思考，嗯，来年的前景。

456
00:24:19,119 --> 00:24:25,119
But I think the current trend is there are more and more jokes online where people are like,
但我觉得目前的趋势是，网上出现越来越多的笑话，人们会说，

457
00:24:25,119 --> 00:24:28,119
this is my new year resolution for the year of the horse,
这是我在马年立下的新年决心，

458
00:24:28,119 --> 00:24:31,119
